# Camera masters, ~196 MB. Deliberately not in git: two of them (11.mov 71 MB,
# 29.mov 62 MB) trip GitHub's 50 MB per-file warning, git stores video with no
# delta compression, and every clone would pull the lot forever. The eleven clips
# the site actually serves ARE committed, under public/videos/, so a fresh clone
# still builds and deploys.
#
# These files exist nowhere else. Back them up separately — see footage/README.md.
footage/

